:00</text>\n<text text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"360\" y=\"439\">05:00</text><text text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"442\" y=\"439\">09:00</text>\n<text text-anchor=\"end\" x=\"518\" y=\"439\">13:00</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reads\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4\">\n<div class=\"rc\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-1\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-1-1\">Aire</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-1-2\">302.4<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-1-2-1\">K</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"rc\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-2\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-2-1\">Proceso</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-2-2\">312.8<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-2-2-1\">K</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"rc\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-3\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-3-1\">Velocidad</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-3-2\">1,421<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-3-2-1\">rpm</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"rc\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-4\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-4-1\">Torque</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-4-2\">62.4<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-4-2-1\">Nm</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"rc\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-5\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-5-1\">Desgaste</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-5-2\">231<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-4-5-2-1\">min</u></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-5\">\n<button class=\"btn solid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-5-1\">Ver activo<i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-5-1-1\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"btn\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-5-2\">Ver riesgo de falla</button>\n<div class=\"spacer\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-5-3\"></div>\n<span class=\"note mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-5-4\">4 alertas en 24 h</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
