ado</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"topright\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"top right action group\">\n<span class=\"stamp mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"data freshness timestamp\">Lecturas hasta 23 nov 13:04</span>\n<button class=\"btn\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"technical assistant button\"><i class=\"icon-book-open\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"open book icon\"></i>Asistente técnico</button>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"content\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"main scrolling content area\">\n<div class=\"vhead\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"view header row\">\n<h1 data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"view headline text\">Telemetría<em data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"view subtitle with machine ID\">Fresadora Cincinnati 4 · FR-204</em></h1>\n<div class=\"tright\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"machine selector group\"><button class=\"ctl\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"machine selector button\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"selected machine name\">Fresadora Cincinnati 4</b><i class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"chevron down icon\"></i></button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"toolbar\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"filter toolbar\">\n<div class=\"tleft\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"left filter group\">\n<div class=\"ctl\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"date range control\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"date range label\">Rango</span><b class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"date range value\">22 nov 13:00 — 23 nov 13:00</b><i class=\"icon-calendar\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"calendar icon\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"seg\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"time range segmented control\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"1 hour segment option\">1 h</span><span class=\"on\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"24 hour active segment option\">24 h</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"7 day seg