51 49 L861 48 L872 48 L882 49 L893 48 L904 48 L914 47 L925 47 L936 48 L946 46 L957 46 L967 47 L978 46 L989 47 L999 47 L1010 46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--air)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<path d=\"M0 26 L11 26 L21 26 L32 26 L43 26 L53 26 L64 26 L74 25 L85 26 L96 25 L106 25 L117 26 L128 25 L138 25 L149 25 L159 25 L170 26 L181 26 L191 25 L202 25 L213 25 L223 25 L234 25 L245 24 L255 25 L266 25 L276 25 L287 25 L298 24 L308 24 L319 25 L330 25 L340 24 L351 24 L361 25 L372 24 L383 24 L393 24 L404 25 L415 24 L425 24 L436 24 L447 24 L457 24 L468 25 L478 24 L489 24 L500 24 L510 24 L521 23 L532 23 L542 23 L553 23 L563 23 L574 24 L585 24 L595 23 L606 23 L617 23 L627 24 L638 23 L649 23 L659 23 L670 23 L680 23 L691 23 L702 22 L712 22 L723 22 L734 22 L744 22 L755 21 L765 22 L776 21 L787 21 L797 22 L808 21 L819 20 L829 21 L840 21 L851 20 L861 20 L872 19 L882 20 L893 19 L904 19 L914 19 L925 19 L936 18 L946 18 L957 19 L967 18 L978 18 L989 17 L999 17 L1010 17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--proc)\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"track\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n<div class=\"tlab\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-1\">\n<div class=\"tname\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-1-1\">Velocidad [rpm]</div>\n<div class=\"srow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-1-2\" style=\"--c:var(--rpm)\"><span class=\"sw2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-1-2-1\"></span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-1-2-2\">Rotación</span><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-1-2-3\">1,421</b></div>\n<div class=\"tlim\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-1-3\" style=\"color:var(--warn)\">límite 1,380</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tyaxis\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-2\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-2-1\" style=\"top:8px\">1700</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-2-2\" style=\"top:36px\">1400</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-2-3\" style=\"top:64px\">1100</span></div>\n<div class=\"tplot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-3\">\n<svg data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-3-1\" height=\"72\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 72\">\n<line stroke=\"var(--grid)\" x1=\"0\