an><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-5-1-2-3\">231</b></div>\n<div class=\"tlim\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-5-1-3\" style=\"color:var(--crit)\">límite 240</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tyaxis\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-5-2\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-5-2-1\" style=\"top:8px\">250</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-5-2-2\" style=\"top:36px\">175</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-5-2-3\" style=\"top:64px\">100</span></div>\n<div class=\"tplot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-5-3\">\n<svg data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-5-3-1\" height=\"72\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 72\">\n<line stroke=\"var(--grid)\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1010\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"8\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"var(--grid)\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1010\" y1=\"36\" y2=\"36\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"var(--line-strong)\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1010\" y1=\"64\" y2=\"64\"></line>\n<line opacity=\".28\" stroke=\"var(--crit)\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"978\" x2=\"978\" y1=\"4\" y2=\"68\"></line>\n<line opacity=\".6\" stroke=\"var(--crit)\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1010\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line>\n<path d=\"M0 61 L11 61 L21 60 L32 59 L43 59 L53 59 L64 58 L74 57 L85 57 L96 57 L106 56 L117 56 L128 55 L138 55 L149 54 L159 54 L170 53 L181 53 L191 52 L202 52 L213 51 L223 51 L234 50 L245 50 L255 49 L266 49 L276 48 L287 47 L298 47 L308 46 L319 46 L330 46 L340 45 L351 45 L361 44 L372 44 L383 44 L393 43 L404 42 L415 42 L425 42 L436 41 L447 41 L457 40 L468 40 L478 39 L489 39 L500 38 L510 38 L521 37 L532 37 L542 37 L553 36 L563 36 L574 35 L585 35 L595 34 L606 34 L617 33 L627 33 L638 32 L649 32 L659 31 L670 31 L680 30 L691 30 L702 29 L712 29 L723 28 L734 27 L744 27 L755 26 L765 26 L776 25 L787 25 L797 24 L808 24 L819 23 L829 23 L840 22 L851 22 L861 22 L872 21 L882 21 L893 20 L904 20 L914 19 L925 19 L936 18 L946 18 L957 17 L967 17 L978 17 L989 16 L999 16 L1010 15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--wear)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"xaxis\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-6\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-6-1\">13:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-6-2\">17:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-6-3\">21:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-6-4\">01:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-6-5\">05:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-6-6\">09:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-6-7\">13:00</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"alerts\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\">\n<div class=\"aheadrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1\">Alertas recientes</h3>\n<a class=\"link\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2\" href=\"#\">Ver historial<i class=\"icon-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-1\"></i></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"atable\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1\">Hora</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\">Variable</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3\">Medición</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-4\">Límite</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-5\">Estado</span></div>\n<div class=\"atrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3\">\n<span class=\"t\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3-1\">12:47</span>\n<span class=\"var\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3-2\">Torque</span>\n<span class=\"meas\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3-3\">64.8 Nm</span>\n<span class=\"lim\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3-4\">61.0 Nm</span>\n<span class=\"state crit\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3-5\"><span class=\"dot crit\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3-5-1\"></span>Crítico</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"atrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-4\">\n<span class=\"t\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-4-1\">11:58</span>\n<span class=\"var\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-4-2\">Desgaste de herramienta</span>\n<span class=\"meas\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-4-3\">228 min</span>\n<span class=\"lim\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-4-4\">220 min</span>\n<span class=\"state crit\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-4-5\"><span class=\"dot crit\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-4-5-1\"></span>Crítico</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
