227 L846 224 L858 217 L869 216 L881 207 L893 205 L905 197 L916 193 L928 187 L940 180 L952 170 L963 165 L975 153 L987 149 L999 140 L1010 131 L1022 121 L1034 117 L1046 102 L1057 97 L1069 89 L1081 76 L1093 69 L1104 60 L1116 49\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--risk)\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path>\n<circle cx=\"952\" cy=\"170\" fill=\"var(--crit)\" r=\"3.2\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"1010\" cy=\"131\" fill=\"var(--crit)\" r=\"3.2\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"1081\" cy=\"76\" fill=\"var(--crit)\" r=\"3.2\"></circle>\n<line opacity=\".7\" stroke=\"var(--line-strong)\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"1116\" x2=\"1116\" y1=\"49\" y2=\"320\"></line>\n<circle cx=\"1116\" cy=\"49\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".35\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"var(--risk)\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"1116\" cy=\"49\" fill=\"var(--risk)\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"xaxis\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-1\">13:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-2\">17:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-3\">21:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-4\">01:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-5\">05:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-6\">09:00</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3-7\">13:00</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"action\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\">\n<div class=\"ic\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1\"><i class=\"icon-wrench\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"txt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2\">\n<div class=\"t1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1\">Inspeccionar torque y desgaste de herramienta</div>\n<div class=\"t2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\">Procedimiento <b data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1\">MP-OSF-03</b> — regla OSF: torque × desgaste <b data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2\">14,414 Nm·min</b>, límite 13,000 para tipo H</div>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn solid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3\">Ver procedimiento<i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3-1\"></i></button>\n</section>\n<section class=\"evid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5\">\n<div class=\"sh\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-1\"><h3 data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-1-1\">Entradas de la estimación</h3><span class=\"faint mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-1-2\" style=\"font-size:10.5px\">23 nov 13:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"evfields\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2\">\n<div class=\"evf\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-1\">Aire</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2\">302.4<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-1\">K</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"evf\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-1\">Proceso</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-2\">312.8<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-2-1\">K</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"evf\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-1\">ΔT</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-2\">10.4<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-2-1\">K</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"evf\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-4\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-4-1\">Velocidad</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-4-2\">1,421<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-4-2-1\">rpm</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"evf\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-5\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-5-1\">Torque</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-5-2\">62.4<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-5-2-1\">Nm</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"evf\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-6\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-6-1\">Desgaste</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-6-2\">231<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-6-2-1\">min</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"evf\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-7\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-7-1\">Potencia</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-7-2\">9,286<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-7-2-1\">W</u></div></div>\n<div class=\"evf\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-8\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-8-1\">Tipo</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-8-2\">H</div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"eval\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6\">\n<div class=\"epanel\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-1\">Comparación de modelos</h3>\n<div class=\"sub\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-2\">Conjunto de prueba, 2,500 registros, partición 75 / 25 estratificada</div>\n<table class=\"mtable\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3\">\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-1\"><th data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-1-1\">Modelo</th><th data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-1-2\">Precisión</th><th data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-1-3\">Recall</th><th data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-1-4\">F1</th><th data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-1-5\">ROC-AUC</th></tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-2\"><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-2-1\">logistic_regression</td><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-2-2\">0.1411</td><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-2-3\">0.8118</td><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-2-4\">0.2404</td><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-2-5\">0.8836</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"sel\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-3\"><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-3-1\">random_forest</td><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-3-2\">0.7901</td><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-3-3\">0.7529</td><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-3-4\">0.7711</td><td data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-3-3-5\">0.9703</td></tr>\n</table>\n<div class=\"sub\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-4\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Selección por mayor F1; desempate por recall. Modelo serializado en <span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-4-1\" style=\"color:var(--fg-2)\">modelo.joblib</span>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"epanel\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-1\">Modos de falla registrados</h3>\n<div class=\"sub\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-2\">AI4I 2020, 10,000 registros etiquetados</div>\n<div class=\"hbars\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3\">\n<div class=\"hb\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-1\"><span class=\"m\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-1-1\">HDF<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-1-1-1\">calor</u></span><span class=\"track\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-1-2\"><span class=\"fill\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-1-2-1\" style=\"width:96%\"></span></span><span class=\"n\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-1-3\">115</span></div>\n<div class=\"hb\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-2\"><span class=\"m\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-2-1\">OSF<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-2-1-1\">esfuerzo</u></span><span class=\"track\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-2-2\"><span class=\"fill\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-2-2-1\" style=\"width:82%\"></span></span><span class=\"n\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-2-3\">98</span></div>\n<div class=\"hb\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-3\"><span class=\"m\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-3-1\">PWF<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-3-1-1\">potencia</u></span><span class=\"track\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-3-2\"><span class=\"fill\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-3-2-1\" style=\"width:79%\"></span></span><span class=\"n\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-3-3\">95</span></div>\n<div class=\"hb\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-4\"><span class=\"m\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-4-1\">TWF<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-4-1-1\">desgaste</u></span><span class=\"track\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-4-2\"><span class=\"fill\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-4-2-1\" style=\"width:38%\"></span></span><span class=\"n\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-4-3\">46</span></div>\n<div class=\"hb\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-5\"><span class=\"m\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-5-1\">RNF<u data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-5-1-1\">aleatoria</u></span><span class=\"track\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-5-2\"><span class=\"fill\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-5-2-1\" style=\"width:16%\"></span></span><span class=\"n\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-5-3\">19</span></div>\n<div class=\"scale\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-6\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-6-1\"></span><span class=\"ruler\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-6-2\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-6-2-1\">0</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-6-2-2\">60</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-6-2-3\">120 registros</span></span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2-3-6-3\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
